  "boundary": "This plan prepares an exact-source, repository-local human review surface for six V1.7.1 retained lanes whose missing evidence can be satisfied by human observation when the other required evidence groups are already present or not required. The harness is not a reviewer, has no PASS control, creates no canonical evidence, cannot manufacture privacy or security truth, and cannot satisfy Assistive Technology, physical-device, performance, energy, Section 48, lifecycle, consumer, deployment, or production acceptance. Accepted human evidence must come from an actual review of the frozen source, be independently recorded with the environment, observations, limitations, and evidence reference, and be evaluated through the governed acceptance process."
